* PDN impedance at the worst-case N4_VNEG_IV pin, from extracted layout.
* Element values: R from the solved copper network, L from the real
* via geometry and routed path, C from the placed part.
* h = outer-layer to first-plane dielectric height in mm (swept),
* because the board declares no stackup.
.param h=0.12
Itest 0 vdd AC 1
Rsrc vdd nsrc 0.0179644
Lsrc nsrc 0 {2.4936e-08*h}
* C443 0603 220000 nF, 79.3 mm from the pin
R0 vdd a0 0.245642
L0 a0 b0 {2.14432e-07*h+5.5e-10}
C0 b0 0 0.00022
Rp0 b0 0 1G
* C424 0402 100 nF, 13.2 mm from the pin
R1 vdd a1 0.0537995
L1 a1 b1 {3.55309e-08*h+4e-10}
C1 b1 0 1e-07
Rp1 b1 0 1G
* C426 0402 100 nF, 5.4 mm from the pin
R2 vdd a2 0.0527704
L2 a2 b2 {1.83467e-08*h+4e-10}
C2 b2 0 1e-07
Rp2 b2 0 1G
.step param h list 0.09 0.12 0.2
.ac dec 400 100000 1e+08
.meas ac zmax MAX mag(V(vdd)) FROM 100000 TO 1e+08
.meas ac zlow FIND mag(V(vdd)) AT=100000
.meas ac zcrit FIND mag(V(vdd)) AT=2.25792e+07
.meas ac zhigh FIND mag(V(vdd)) AT=1e+08
.meas ac fcross WHEN mag(V(vdd))=1.75 RISE=1
.end
